          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: सहसा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सहसा (sahasā) — \"suddenly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सहसा (sahasā) is \"all at once, without warning\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Underneath it is sahas, \"force, a sudden strength\", put into the shape that means by means of: by force, and so at a rush. कृपया, the please you already say, is made the very same way out of kṛpā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It carries a shade of judgement with it — a thing done सहसा (sahasā) is a thing done without thinking first."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One thing happening at a rush, and a mild opinion about it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
