          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: प्रायः",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रायः (prāyaḥ) — \"mostly, for the most part\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रायः (prāyaḥ) is \"for the most part, in the main, usually\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say it when something holds most of the time and you would rather not promise more than that. It is pra-, \"forward\", with the going-piece you met in विहगः: what runs out in front, what happens in the main."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Beside सर्वम्, which claims everything, प्रायः (prāyaḥ) claims almost everything and keeps its hedge."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A reply that is honest about not being certain."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
