          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किञ्चित् (kiñcit) — \"a little, somewhat\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "किञ्चित् (kiñcit) is \"a bit, somewhat, a small amount\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It is किम्, the what you have been asking with since your first questions, wearing the same little cit that softened कदाचित् (kadācit). What gone vague is something — and something said of a quantity is a little."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अल्पम् describes a small thing; किञ्चित् (kiñcit) measures a small amount of it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A small helping of an answer."
